rg Economics measure, while a government campaign to reduce financial risk coincides with weaker activity. On the other hand, given that the impact of a trade war with the United States can not yet be known, the authorities develop multiple efforts to maintain the flow of credit without declaring a complete policy change.\par \par \uc2 The Yuan entry falls to one-year lows after signals from the \uc2 Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of a looser monetary policy was first published in La Tercera.\par \par \uc2 Dokument NFINCE0020180719ee7j00e9z\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
