\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: Dollar steadies as trade-war worries cool--for now\b0\par\par\uc2 663 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Juni 2018\par 00:33\par \uc2 Dow Jones Newswires Chinese (English)\par \uc2 RTNW\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2018, Dow Jones & Company, Inc. \par \par \uc2 By Sara Sjolin, \uc2 MarketWatch\uc2  , Anneken Tappe\par \par \uc2 The dollar saw muted action Wednesday, as major \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading calmed somewhat, a day after fears of a trade war between China and the U.S. sparked fresh haven buying.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. \uc2 ICE\uc2  Dollar Index , which measures the greenback against a basket of six rivals, was little changed in negative territory at 95.095, after touching an 11-month peak on Tuesday, underlining a period of relative placidity after markets were thrown into a tizzy after the U.S. threatened to place tariffs on an additional $400 billion ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.marketwatch.com/story/trump-seeks-additional-200-billion-in-tariffs-against-china-and-threatens-even-more-2018-06-18"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.marketwatch.com/story/trump-seeks-additional-200-billion-in-tariffs-against-china-and-threatens-even-more-2018-06-18}}}\uc2 ) worth of Chinese imports and Beijing warned it would retaliate ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.marketwatch.com/story/china-threatens-further-tariffs-on-us-products-as-trade-conflict-escalates-2018-06-19"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.marketwatch.com/story/china-threatens-further-tariffs-on-us-products-as-trade-conflict-escalates-2018-06-19}}}\uc2 ).\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, flight to assets perceived as safe sent investors fleeing to the likes of the Japanese yen ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.marketwatch.com/story/trade-turmoil-sparks-flight-to-haven-currencies-as-yen-and-dollar-rally-2018-06-19"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.marketwatch.com/story/trade-turmoil-sparks-flight-to-haven-\b  \highlight22currencies\b0 \highlight22 -as-yen-and-dollar-rally-2018-06-19}}}\uc2 ), a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  popular during times of global uncertainty.\par \par \uc2 Don't miss:Here's one way for British-pound bulls to prep for the \uc2 Bank of England\uc2  policy meeting ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.marketwatch.com/story/heres-one-way-for-british-pound-bulls-to-prepare-for-the-bank-of-england-policy-meeting-2018-06-20"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.marketwatch.com/story/heres-one-way-for-british-pound-bulls-to-prepare-for-the-bank-of-england-policy-meeting-2018-06-20}}}\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 However, a lack of news on the trade front on Wednesday, the panic subsided, leaving \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets relatively flat. A broader gauge of dollar strength, the WSJ Dollar Index , was 0.1% stronger at 88.31.\par \par \uc2 Read:Here's why a trade-war selloff won't spark \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's yuan ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.marketwatch.com/story/theres-no-trade-war-panic-in-chinas-yuan-2018-06-19"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.marketwatch.com/story/theres-no-trade-war-panic-in-chinas-yuan-2018-06-19}}}\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 Also see:Here's why trade-war fears trump the \uc2 Bank of Japan\uc2  when it comes to the yen ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.marketwatch.com/story/heres-why-trade-war-fears-trump-the-bank-of-japan-when-it-comes-to-the-yen-2018-06-15"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.marketwatch.com/story/heres-why-trade-war-fears-trump-the-bank-of-japan-when-it-comes-to-the-yen-2018-06-15}}}\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 The yen , meanwhile, retreated somewhat, with the dollar fetching Yen110.43, compared with Yen110.06 late Tuesday in New York.\par \par \uc2 Also in focus for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  investors was the \uc2 European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's forum in Sintra, Portugal, which included a panel discussion with the \uc2 ECB\uc2 's \uc2 Mario Draghi\uc2 , \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  boss \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2 , \uc2 Bank of Japan Gov. Haruhiko Kuroda\uc2 , and Reserve Bank of Australia Gov. Philip Lowe.\par \par \uc2 While all central bankers were rather measured and careful in their comments, Draghi and Powell agreed in their assessment that it was too early to tell how the announced and threatened tariffs would impact monetary policy, although it was possible that they would. Kuroda added that Japan's economy could see a significant indirect impact from the escalating tensions.\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, Draghi highlighted the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's dovish message on monetary policy in Sintra, indicating that it could extend its bond-buying program if necessary ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.marketwatch.com/story/ecbs-draghi-says-bank-could-extend-qe-if-warranted-2018-06-19"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.marketwatch.com/story/ecbs-draghi-says-bank-could-extend-qe-if-warranted-2018-06-19}}}\uc2 ). The eurolast bought $1.1585, down 0.1%, according to FactSet.\par \par \uc2 "Some market participants had thought he might use his speech to fight back against the market's dovish interpretation of his comments," said Marshall Gittler, chief strategist at ACLS Global. "It's clear to me that the monetary diversion trade is back in force for the euro-dollar pair, which is likely to lead the dollar higher, assuming that is, that Trump's trade war doesn't lead it off a cliff."\par \par \uc2 Check out:Here's how the \uc2 ECB\uc2  just breathed new life into the dollar rally, analysts say ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.marketwatch.com/story/heres-how-the-ecb-just-breathed-new-life-into-the-dollar-rally-analysts-say-2018-06-14"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.marketwatch.com/story/heres-how-the-ecb-just-breathed-new-life-into-the-dollar-rally-analysts-say-2018-06-14}}}\uc2 )